---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ProjectLinks from '../components/ProjectLinks.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Misc" description="Smaller tools, earlier scientific work, and assorted interests from Zhichao Li.">
  <div class="shell simple-page">
    <article class="plain-content">
      <p>I built <a href="https://github.com/b1tank/wg-gnome-ext">WireGuard Manager for GNOME</a> to control and inspect local VPN tunnels from the desktop panel, and <a href="https://github.com/b1tank/git-remote-helper">Git Remote Helper</a> to create durable GitHub links to selected lines in VS Code.</p>

      <p>My earlier scientific work includes a <a href="https://github.com/b1tank/DSM-f90">Fortran aerosol model</a>, a few <a href="https://github.com/b1tank/computational-fluid-dynamics-basics">computational-fluid-dynamics fundamentals</a>, and <a href="https://github.com/b1tank/kmeans-clustering-pyspark">geospatial clustering with PySpark</a>.</p>

      <p>I maintain <span class="project-name">BoringBlog</span><ProjectLinks repository="https://github.com/b1tank/boringblog" demo="https://lezhiweng.com" label="BoringBlog" /> for my family and occasionally build things with them, including <span class="project-name">ABC Balloon</span><ProjectLinks repository="https://github.com/b1tank/abc" demo="https://b1tank.github.io/projects/abc/demo/" label="ABC Balloon" />.</p>

      <p>When I’m away from the keyboard, I like basketball and billiards. I’m a Warriors fan and still find Stephen Curry’s combination of movement, geometry, repetition, and calm unusually instructive.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
